==Description==
'''Griddy''' emote is an emote that could have been obtained at Level 34 of the regular [[Ducky Revenge Event#Ducky Revenge Battle Pass|Ducky Revenge Battle Pass]]. It was made by STEALTH_NOVA. It is looped and moveable, but not interactable. No music can be heard while performing the emote.

It had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|1,190}} or {{Robux|98}} ({{Robux|83}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|19,030}} or {{Robux|2,810}} ({{Robux|2,372}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

